{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Powerful Special Skills by Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/unit_special_attack_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Robots have unique special skills that excel in emergency situations and when facing large numbers of enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These special skills can be charged through experience points, capsules, and merchants after clearing stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Weapons for Each Robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/main_unit_list.gif?t=1743075491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each robot can utilize three main weapons, with two skill trees available for each main weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the formations of sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the demo version, only one type of robot can be used.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Through Leveling Up</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/level_up_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By defeating enemies in stages, you gain experience points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reaching certain experience thresholds allows you to level up and choose skill cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Various Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/boss_list_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against unique bosses across a total of 10 stages, each with their own distinct characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the demo version, you can progress up to stage 5.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tense Boss Battles and Diverse Attack Patterns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/boss_attack_type_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two bosses are the same, and most will randomly use one of three special attack patterns, providing enjoyment even in repeated playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Elements - Robots and Main Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/upgrade_unit_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your robot\u2019s stats and traits using in-game currency gained from gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also unlock and enhance weapon skills to see changes in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Elements - Sub Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/upgrade_sub_weapon_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each sub weapon comes with two skill trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen and level up your sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the demo version, only three types of sub weapons are available.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3103700?t=1743075491","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3103700?t=1743075491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai