nemies in stages, you gain experience points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reaching certain experience thresholds allows you to level up and choose skill cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Various Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/boss_list_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against unique bosses across a total of 10 stages, each with their own distinct characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the demo version, you can progress up to stage 5.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tense Boss Battles and Diverse Attack Patterns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/boss_attack_type_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two bosses are the same, and most will randomly use one of three special attack patterns, providing enjoyment even in repeated playthroughs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Elements - Robots and Main Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/upgrade_unit_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your robot\u2019s stats and traits using in-game currency gained from gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also unlock and enhance weapon skills to see changes in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth Elements - Sub Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/extras/upgrade_sub_weapon_640.gif?t=1743075491\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each sub weapon comes with two skill trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen and level up your sub weapons to create your own unique weapon formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the demo version, only three types of sub weapons are available.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Creative Gorae"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3092280","name":"Guardians Of Restoration"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103700/d77ce5c4b766f78271c5c229ab0dc77c3781089a/header.jpg?t=1743075491","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257040703,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257040703/movie480.mp4?t=1743075489","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257040703/movie_max.mp4?t=1743075489"},"name":"Guardians Of Restoration","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257040703/0d5de8d6b0384fd441591695dceaeae9f2ff086c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743075489","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257040703/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743075489","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257040703/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743075489"}}],"name":"Guardians Of Restoration Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Corei7-11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Iris Xe Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publish